@startuml
title Component Diagram - Device Gateway va Camera Integration

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

package "Device Side" <<subsystem>> {
  component "IoT Firmware\naiot_code_v3.py" as Firmware <<component>>
  component "Virtual Simulator\nvirtual_device_simulator.py" as Simulator <<component>>
}

package "Gateway Runtime" <<subsystem>> {
  component "gateway.py" as GatewayComp <<component>>
}

package "Backend API" <<subsystem>> {
  component "TelemetryController" as TelemetryController <<component>>
  component "CommandController" as CommandController <<component>>
}

component "Camera Service\ncamera_interface.py" as Camera <<component>>

interface "ITelemetryAPI" as ITelemetry
interface "ICommandPollingAPI" as ICommand
interface "ICommandAckAPI" as IAck
interface "ICameraAPI" as ICamera

Firmware --> GatewayComp : telemetry / command
Simulator --> GatewayComp : telemetry / command

GatewayComp ..> ITelemetry : required socket\nHTTP REST
GatewayComp ..> ICommand : required socket\nHTTP polling
GatewayComp ..> IAck : required socket\nHTTP REST
GatewayComp ..> ICamera : required socket\nHTTP /check_human

ITelemetry - TelemetryController : provided lollipop
ICommand - CommandController : provided lollipop
IAck - CommandController : provided lollipop
ICamera - Camera : provided lollipop

note bottom of GatewayComp
Port: integration client
Source: gateway.py
end note

@enduml
